# 统一换行符：容器内脚本必须是 LF，否则 `sh` 会报 ": not found" / exec format error
* text=auto

*.sh            text eol=lf
Dockerfile      text eol=lf
*.Dockerfile    text eol=lf
docker-compose.yml text eol=lf
*.yml           text eol=lf
*.yaml          text eol=lf
*.sql           text eol=lf

# 二进制：不要做行尾转换
*.png           binary
*.jpg           binary
*.ico           binary
*.pdf           binary
